  "description": "One execution of one Pipeline Mapping. PARTIAL is a first-class status and must never be collapsed into SUCCESS or FAILED: a run that wrote 9,900 of 10,000 rows is neither, and flattening it is how silent data loss happens. Shown as Logs per sync and as Insights across syncs.",
